@startuml
actor Simulador
participant EventHub
participant DeliveryStartedHandler as Handler
participant "Goroutine 1s" as G
queue "Kafka simulation" as K
Simulador -> EventHub : DeliveryStarted
EventHub -> Handler : handleDeliveryStarted
Handler -> G : start(rota.directions)
loop coordenadas
G -> EventHub : chDriverMoved
EventHub -> K : WriteMessages
end
note bottom
Consumer do canal expira em 500ms,
mas produtor emite a cada 1s.
end note
@enduml
